WEBVTT

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:15.820
All that's left to do now is to assemble the specialized armor.

00:00:16.320 --> 00:00:19.790
And then GaoGaiGar's backup robot will be all set to go, right?

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:23.040
As long as there are no problems with the new Al system.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.210
The Al System is absolutely problem-free!

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:27.790
And why wouldn't it be?

00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:33.170
It's got the heroic, powerful, courageous, gentle, noble...

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:38.640
...personality of yours truly! I'm the one they based the system on!

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:40.060
No problem!

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:42.180
Remember that in the heat of the battle, now!

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:47.230
Is that true?

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:47.860
Huh?

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:51.230
Oh, you mean I haven't told you yet, Mikoto?

00:00:52.190 --> 00:00:54.990
Remember how it took more than 6 months...

00:00:55.070 --> 00:00:57.570
...to develop HyoRyu and EnRyu's AI?

00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:01.410
Even Volfogg, developed with the backing of the government...

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:04.500
...and the Intelligence Agency, took 3 months.

00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:08.840
But this time around we don't have time to develop the AI.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:13.170
Our only option was to mirror a specific human's thought patterns.

00:01:14.260 --> 00:01:16.090
So you used the Major as your model?

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:20.350
Goldymarg, a robot built to be GaoGaiGar's backup...

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:24.100
...is equipped with the latest Al system.

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:32.440
With the next battle on the horizon, can he become the Key to Victory?

00:01:33.190 --> 00:01:36.190
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:36.190 --> 00:01:39.090
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:45.960
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:46.440 --> 00:01:50.090
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:52.210 --> 00:01:56.810
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:58.130 --> 00:02:01.090
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:02:01.090 --> 00:02:06.010
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:02:06.010 --> 00:02:09.930
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:02:09.930 --> 00:02:12.730
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:02:12.730 --> 00:02:16.490
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:21.490
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:24.660
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:27.200
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:27.400 --> 00:02:30.330
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:30.330 --> 00:02:33.290
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:33.540 --> 00:02:37.370
Dividing Driver!

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:45.010
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:50.890
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:50.890 --> 00:02:53.840
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:57.730
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:57.240 --> 00:02:59.820
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:59.900 --> 00:03:02.780
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:03:05.120 --> 00:03:05.160
The Golden God of Destruction

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:08.000
<i>The Golden God of Destruction</i>

00:03:10.710 --> 00:03:13.790
We're bringing you this report from the Gotenyama Science Center...

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:17.380
...where an exciting gravity control test is about to be conducted.

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:21.550
And the scientist who won the race to complete such a system...

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:24.970
...is none other than Japan's top physicist, a genius in her field...

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:27.600
Dr. Akiko Hirata!

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:34.440
Based on a theory I developed, this gravity control system will...

00:03:34.650 --> 00:03:36.770
...make it possible for us to manipulate gravity at will...

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:40.320
...everything from high gravity to anti-gravity.

00:03:40.860 --> 00:03:43.570
Now then, let me show you.

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:45.910
Behold, the power of anti-gravity will cause a...

00:03:45.990 --> 00:03:48.240
...10-ton trailer truck to float in mid-air!

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:11.520
It can't be...

00:04:18.480 --> 00:04:22.450
The circuits are malfunctioning due to the humidity in this room.

00:04:22.530 --> 00:04:25.110
Therefore I am canceling today's presentation.

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:28.620
You will be advised of the next test date later.

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:31.040
But that will be it for today.

00:04:31.370 --> 00:04:32.870
Dr. Hirata! Dr. Hirata!

00:04:33.290 --> 00:04:34.830
Please, come back here!

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:38.170
Are you saying your device is malfunction-prone?

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:40.050
Dr. Hirata!

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:48.350
I don't understand it...

00:04:48.470 --> 00:04:49.890
How could this have happened?

00:04:50.720 --> 00:04:52.350
My calculations for converting the...

00:04:52.480 --> 00:04:54.480
...potential energy in the Higgs Field are foolproof!

00:04:55.060 --> 00:04:59.570
It should have produced anti-gravity measuring -3.16G without fail!

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:06.740
My theory is rock-solid, so why...

00:05:10.660 --> 00:05:12.040
But no!

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:13.700
That's not possible!

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:17.120
This is the woman, yes?

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:24.010
No question, she is the ideal host to help execute our plan.

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:26.470
Now then...

00:05:32.560 --> 00:05:36.230
Go ahead and manipulate gravity to your heart's content!

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:39.150
Gravity...

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:42.070
That's right, do as you will!

00:05:42.780 --> 00:05:44.530
Do as I will...

00:05:44.940 --> 00:05:46.780
With gravity!

00:05:55.330 --> 00:05:56.370
No way!

00:05:58.790 --> 00:06:00.040
I'm not afraid, I'm not afraid...

00:06:02.590 --> 00:06:06.630
But we've got a physical today at school...

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:17.890
What the...

00:06:39.500 --> 00:06:41.670
I'll see you later!

00:06:45.920 --> 00:06:47.470
I've just heard from Mamoru...

00:06:47.550 --> 00:06:49.510
...and he says he can sense a Zonder underground...

00:06:49.680 --> 00:06:50.760
Underground?

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:55.180
I'm getting an Element Z0 reading at a point 15 meters below ground.

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:58.730
It's at the same location as that traffic accident!

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:00.270
Are you serious?

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:01.560
Hold on a minute!

00:07:02.360 --> 00:07:05.520
I've detected a pattern of movement at the particle source.

00:07:05.690 --> 00:07:07.530
So the Zonder's moving underground?

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:09.820
Wait, I'm going to reverse-plot the route it's taking.

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:16.290
The source is the Science Center?

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:25.920
We're counting on you! HyoRyu! EnRyu!

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:27.050
Yes, sir!

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:42.650
Stay calm! You're almost there!

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:49.190
Cannon Blue!

00:07:49.400 --> 00:07:50.950
Cannon Red!

00:07:56.910 --> 00:07:58.950
We've successfully prevented a landslide.

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:02.040
We used a super-fast hardening epoxy.

00:08:02.210 --> 00:08:05.880
It takes some skill to nail the timing for mixing the two elements!

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:10.460
Good job, EnRyu and HyoRyu!

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:12.220
Gai! What's the situation?

00:08:12.430 --> 00:08:14.140
It looks like that's what caused the accident.

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.560
Apparently something just moved through there...

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:21.680
Just as we thought, the Zonder appears to be moving underground...

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:23.230
...below G-Island City.

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.440
Now starting analysis.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:32.610
The Z-Sensor has detected traces of Element Z0.

00:08:32.860 --> 00:08:33.780
But this is...

00:08:37.240 --> 00:08:40.660
I must contact the Main Order Room!

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:46.750
Oh, thanks so much!

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:48.880
Weight overload!

00:08:49.300 --> 00:08:51.090
Weight overload!

00:08:51.460 --> 00:08:52.760
Weight overload!

00:08:52.880 --> 00:08:54.630
Could it be me?

00:08:54.970 --> 00:08:57.550
The moment I stepped inside...

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.810
Lunchtime!

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:03.730
Aren't you eating, Hana?

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:09.190
If you don't like what's on your plate, I'll be happy to eat it!

00:09:10.980 --> 00:09:13.990
Come on, everybody, can't you understand the feminine soul?

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:15.110
Feminine soul?

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:18.660
I'll be blunt, you've gained weight, haven't you?

00:09:21.910 --> 00:09:26.710
There's a physical this afternoon, so you're on a crash diet, right?

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:30.040
I do pity you!

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:32.710
Because I'm the type of person who never gains weight...

00:09:32.800 --> 00:09:34.170
...no matter how much I eat!

00:09:35.090 --> 00:09:37.010
Just look at these skinny legs of mine!

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:40.680
Reiko, are you all right?

00:09:45.980 --> 00:09:49.650
Hey, maybe you need to go on a diet too, huh?

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:54.610
I feel so heavy! Do I need to cut back too?

00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:56.490
Don't compare me with you!

00:09:57.030 --> 00:09:58.610
What's the matter with you two?

00:10:00.160 --> 00:10:01.160
Zonder!

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:12.170
My body's getting heavier and heavier!

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:16.090
If we don't stop getting any heavier, then I'm going to...

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:21.180
Much obliged!

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:26.140
I don't want to turn into a sumo wrestler!

00:10:32.400 --> 00:10:34.190
The rubble's suddenly gotten heavier...

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:36.610
What is this pressure?

00:10:52.630 --> 00:10:54.550
Gai! Answer me, Gai!

00:10:54.670 --> 00:10:59.510
I'm seeing a steady increase in Higgs particles below the unitary limit!

00:10:59.630 --> 00:11:02.260
The gravity coefficient is still rising!

00:11:02.510 --> 00:11:03.680
Unbelievable!

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:07.310
The potential energy of the Higgs field is rising at an abnormal rate...

00:11:07.430 --> 00:11:08.930
...all across G-Island City!

00:11:09.100 --> 00:11:11.100
Explain that to us in layman's terms, please!

00:11:11.310 --> 00:11:12.940
It's abnormally high gravity.

00:11:13.020 --> 00:11:14.900
It makes heavy objects heavier...

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:19.280
...the higher the mass, the faster its weight increases.

00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:21.700
In other words, if this keeps up...

00:11:23.490 --> 00:11:25.780
We're all going to get crushed!

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:29.790
No!

00:11:31.830 --> 00:11:36.380
We're not just going to get crushed, it'll sink all of G-Island!

00:11:41.340 --> 00:11:43.470
This is Volfogg...

00:11:43.550 --> 00:11:47.850
I have discovered a gravity-manipulating entity underground...

00:11:49.480 --> 00:11:52.140
Did he say gravity-manipulating?

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:01.030
Zonder!

00:12:04.570 --> 00:12:07.410
A.I. System out of order...

00:12:08.290 --> 00:12:09.870
We're gonna be crushed!

00:12:12.210 --> 00:12:14.250
No good, I can't move!

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:28.600
Isn't there anybody who can move?

00:12:29.010 --> 00:12:33.270
So now all our hopes are dashed!

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:47.990
W-What's that?

00:12:52.790 --> 00:12:54.710
It started moving on its own?

00:12:58.840 --> 00:13:02.210
Goldymarg!

00:13:08.100 --> 00:13:10.850
You mean all this gravity isn't stopping him from moving?

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:12.520
He must have unbelievable power!

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:19.400
Goldymarg, where do you think you're going?

00:13:19.610 --> 00:13:22.280
Look, there's no time to lose, moron.

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:37.790
We have a situation in the Metal Locker Room!

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:39.960
Goldymarg just mobilized himself!

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:42.630
Why? Did somebody launch his A.I. system?

00:13:42.880 --> 00:13:44.800
We haven't even run the system tests yet!

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:48.220
Goldymarg is our last hope!

00:13:53.020 --> 00:13:54.520
So fragile...

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:58.650
All we did was increase the gravity a bit, see how helpless they are!

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:02.780
This is the end for those four robots who are always getting in our way!

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:05.900
What's that?

00:14:10.030 --> 00:14:12.660
My, what a stunning robot!

00:14:12.790 --> 00:14:15.750
He appears to be headed toward the Zonder.

00:15:01.540 --> 00:15:02.960
What the...

00:15:06.380 --> 00:15:09.340
Could this be antigravity?

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:47.210
Zonder!

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:56.970
Zonder!

00:16:07.230 --> 00:16:08.730
Just where does he think he's aiming?

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:12.570
No!

00:16:12.650 --> 00:16:15.070
The effects of the gravity have bent the beam's trajectory!

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:30.010
Zonder!

00:16:38.350 --> 00:16:40.180
Yay! My body's light again!

00:16:41.640 --> 00:16:44.100
They sure did a number on us.

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:46.230
Was it Goldymarg who stopped it?

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:48.400
Let's get back to the Main Order Room.

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:49.150
Right!

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:53.240
That high-gravity observatory weighs more than 3,000 tons.

00:16:53.360 --> 00:16:56.070
The shock would have been similar to that of a cannon!

00:16:56.530 --> 00:16:59.240
The gravity coefficient has returned to normal levels!

00:16:59.870 --> 00:17:02.410
I'm receiving a signal from Gai, requesting approval for Fusion!

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:05.000
All right, now we're going to strike back!

00:17:05.120 --> 00:17:07.330
Zonder!

00:17:16.220 --> 00:17:18.220
Goldymarg, it's our turn now!

00:17:18.390 --> 00:17:20.010
Now that we can move freely, nothing can stop us!

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:22.060
Zonder!

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:25.020
Take that! Take that! Take that!

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:30.150
No!

00:17:30.360 --> 00:17:33.240
We've got to hurry, before the gravity device regenerates!

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:35.860
Please, let me take care of this!

00:17:36.740 --> 00:17:38.530
Melting Siren!

00:17:41.790 --> 00:17:42.660
Now!

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:44.370
Take that!

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:48.630
All right!

00:17:48.750 --> 00:17:50.420
Final Fusion, approved!

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:51.500
Roger!

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:53.090
Final Fusion...

00:17:53.210 --> 00:17:55.340
Program... drive!

00:17:59.260 --> 00:18:03.100
Final Fusion!

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:46.930
GaoGaiGar!

00:18:50.650 --> 00:18:51.860
Goldymarg!

00:18:51.980 --> 00:18:54.110
That Zonder ravaged the whole city...

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:57.030
Let's blast it together with our ultimate attack!

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.950
I can handle that thing by myself, but what the heck.

00:19:01.070 --> 00:19:02.700
That's my real mission, anyway.

00:19:07.660 --> 00:19:09.710
Goldion Hammer...

00:19:09.870 --> 00:19:12.000
Activation, approved!

00:19:15.630 --> 00:19:16.420
Roger!

00:19:16.760 --> 00:19:18.170
Goldion Hammer...

00:19:18.300 --> 00:19:21.720
Safety Device, relieve!

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:28.390
System Change!

00:19:41.820 --> 00:19:44.160
Hammer Connect!

00:19:49.750 --> 00:19:52.830
Goldion Hammer!

00:19:57.710 --> 00:20:00.510
Hammer Hell!

00:20:05.180 --> 00:20:07.850
Hammer Heaven!

00:20:15.060 --> 00:20:18.110
Transform into light!

00:20:32.660 --> 00:20:35.130
All right! Yay!

00:20:40.010 --> 00:20:41.260
Gai...

00:20:44.970 --> 00:20:47.220
Big Brother Gai!

00:20:47.680 --> 00:20:49.640
Hey, nice timing, Mamoru!

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:51.890
That right arm of yours was really awesome!

00:20:52.020 --> 00:20:55.190
Yeah, now there's no danger of GaoGaiGar ever breaking down...

00:20:55.440 --> 00:20:57.520
...no matter how many times I use the Goldion Hammer!

00:20:58.020 --> 00:21:00.190
Okay, Mamoru, I need you to purify that Zonder.

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:03.740
Curatio!

00:21:04.450 --> 00:21:07.450
Teneritas, sectio...

00:21:07.910 --> 00:21:11.790
...salus, coctura!

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:29.180
I'm glad G-Island was saved, but my observatory...

00:21:32.310 --> 00:21:33.310
No problem!

00:21:33.430 --> 00:21:35.890
Goldymarg will help you get it back in working order!

00:21:36.060 --> 00:21:38.190
After all, he's patterned after my personality...

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:41.360
...meaning he's not only gung-ho, but a kind-hearted soul as well!

00:21:41.480 --> 00:21:43.030
Isn't that right, Goldymarg?

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:44.400
It's not gonna happen.

00:21:44.530 --> 00:21:45.950
What did you say?

00:21:46.320 --> 00:21:48.030
My mission is to stay in optimal condition...

00:21:48.160 --> 00:21:52.490
...so that the Goldion Hammer can be used at any given time.

00:21:52.950 --> 00:21:55.910
I have the right to refuse low priority orders like that.

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:57.830
Say that again, you little...

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:00.960
It's so obvious that they used the Major's personality...

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:02.800
...for Goldymarg's A.I. System!

00:22:02.920 --> 00:22:05.010
Stubborn as a mule, isn't he?

00:22:05.380 --> 00:22:07.680
Even the way he refuses to follow orders is exactly like Hyuuma!

00:22:12.560 --> 00:22:14.020
Good heavens...

00:22:15.890 --> 00:22:16.980
Thank goodness...

00:22:17.060 --> 00:22:22.360
Now Gai and GaoGaiGar can fight as hard as they want!

00:22:25.070 --> 00:22:28.110
At last, the ultimate GaoGaiGar is complete...

00:22:28.820 --> 00:22:30.530
Hammer Hell and Heaven...

00:22:30.660 --> 00:22:33.540
...the ultimate attack surpassing even Hell and Heaven...

00:22:33.740 --> 00:22:35.870
There's no question that it's Goldymarg...

00:22:36.000 --> 00:22:40.130
...who holds the key to mankind's survival!

00:22:46.410 --> 00:22:50.310
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.510 --> 00:22:55.180
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.580 --> 00:23:01.360
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.360 --> 00:23:06.150
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:10.320
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.490 --> 00:23:17.250
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:24.010
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:28.670
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:29.360 --> 00:23:34.010
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:40.910
someday in the Sea of Stars.
